From d9863f5bacd0cf5ec03f0352297395e57f93e3d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:25:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/92] test: /v1/images/classify integration suite, fake
 tflite-server, docs

server_image_classify.py covers the pre-body 411/413 guard, request
validation, cross-route refusals, backend 4xx preservation and all four
prefixes, against a real tflite-server image model or a stand-in backend
that also proves a crashing input is not replayed. Documents the route,
its limits and the image model directory.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
